Changes made to the original work, as required by section 4(b) of the licence:

- share/hollywood/compat.sh (new): platform layer sourced by every widget.
- share/hollywood/shims/ (new): stand-ins for ccze, apg, speedometer, atop and batcat.
- lib/hollywood/*: source the platform layer; Linux-only paths, GNU-only options and
  the kill-by-pattern trap replaced.
- bin/hollywood: CPU count on macOS, widgets tracked by tmux window id, --version,
  usage error for unknown options, session closed only if the script created it.
- Removed: wallstreet (now its own project), the Debian and snap packaging,
  third-party screenshots.
- Added: tests, release tooling, Homebrew formula, project page.

The file share/hollywood/soundwave.mp4 and share/hollywood/map.jpg are distributed
unchanged from the original work.
